{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年71歲的歌手陳美齡（Agnes）婚後長居日本，但向來重視家庭。</p><p>她日前在社交平台上載了一輯為二姐夫慶祝大壽的溫馨合照，二家姐陳曦齡與「富豪御醫」二姐夫謝德富難得聯袂亮相，現場氣氛融洽。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;相中</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.111931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.264235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"1a96344b5010643d33ab60053f5dc3e0ccdb890e96d5688602de5f83340c807a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}